Third-party material
--------------------
No third-party source code is vendored yet. When code is copied or ported,
it is listed here with its origin and licence, and file-level provenance is
recorded in third_party/README.md (see docs/DECISIONS.md, ADR-030).

Planned entries:
- Behavioural port of Laya (NandhaKishorM/laya @ 010bacef),
  Copyright Convai Innovations, Apache License 2.0.
- FlashAttention-2 kernels (BSD-3-Clause, Tri Dao) and CUTLASS
  (BSD-3-Clause, NVIDIA), once vendored into arbitro-cuda.

Model weights
-------------
Laya checkpoints are never included in this repository, its images or its
release assets. They are downloaded by the user from their original
repositories, and their licence terms apply to the user.
